o4_vector_dump_tests decodes Core-produced mnlistdiff and qrinfo payloads with Core's own
CSimplifiedMNListDiff/CQuorumRotationInfo, checks that Core re-serializes them byte for byte,
and writes per-entry CalcHash values, commitment hashes and merkle roots as JSON.
o4_harness_audit_tests repeats the flag-perturbation checks of transaction_tests/script_tests
